-style variable markers or filter expressions; deliberate dynamic Folios may use them with a declared context.
* **Literal test:** transcluding a simple call produces the single-line body with its arguments substituted and unused dimensions filled from defaults. The Example Zero Inscription meme carries a fixed expected rendering and a default-value probe for comparison.
* **Rendering boundaries:** keep markdown code fences, TOML header and Lares ahu wrappers outside the wikitext pasted into a live TW5 test tiddler. Only the native procedure declaration and calls participate.
* **Image-model boundary:** backtick delimiters reduce one way quotation marks can accidentally act as print-text cues in image prompts. TW5 syntax alone cannot guarantee how any image model will interpret that source.
<<~/ahu>>
